      content: "# fastgrep\n[![CI](https://github.com/example/fastgrep/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/example/fastgrep/actions)\nA tiny, fast grep clone.\n## Install\n```sh\ncargo install fastgrep\n```\n## Usage\n1. Build the index: `fastgrep index .`\n2. Search: `fastgrep find \"needle\"`\n## Features\n* Regex support\n* Respects `.gitignore`\n* including nested ignore files\n## License\nMIT"
